    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK MORE GAMES</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><br>Food Empire is an economic strategy game in which you will be able to build your own restaurant business. You will begin with one small diner in a location of your choosing, and in time you will be able to expand to different areas. The game lets you take control of many aspects of managing restaurants, and allows for some personal customization of your brand's look.<br><br>It goes like this:<br><br>First you choose a building to buy, while considering various different factors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/fc87230a42ce91695c8501a28f38cf43.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/fc87230a42ce91695c8501a28f38cf43.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/fc87230a42ce91695c8501a28f38cf43.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not its time to renovate. Sell all the junk you find and choose the look of walls and floors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/e7b96e6f4b3ecdc4dd6a61f68d026107.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/e7b96e6f4b3ecdc4dd6a61f68d026107.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/e7b96e6f4b3ecdc4dd6a61f68d026107.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Design the restaurant yourself. In time you will be able to unlock many additional interior items.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/7607f17daf0e481053ba0f6d342cddfe.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/7607f17daf0e481053ba0f6d342cddfe.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/7607f17daf0e481053ba0f6d342cddfe.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Pick your staff according to their skill level and payment expectations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/bb5e561a2e5a398254256741baf484ee.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/bb5e561a2e5a398254256741baf484ee.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/bb5e561a2e5a398254256741baf484ee.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Finally - feed your customers!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/c4b71ca58cf385a4af0ee536ed316b05.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/c4b71ca58cf385a4af0ee536ed316b05.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/c4b71ca58cf385a4af0ee536ed316b05.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In time new opportunities will open up and allow for branching out into different food businesses. Manage your finances, take care of your customer's needs and slowly but surely you will build your Food Empire.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><br>Food Empire is an economic strategy game in which you will be able to build your own restaurant business. You will begin with one small diner in a location of your choosing, and in time you will be able to expand to different areas. The game lets you take control of many aspects of managing restaurants, and allows for some personal customization of your brand's look.<br><br>It goes like this:<br><br>First you choose a building to buy, while considering various different factors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/fc87230a42ce91695c8501a28f38cf43.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/fc87230a42ce91695c8501a28f38cf43.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/fc87230a42ce91695c8501a28f38cf43.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Not its time to renovate. Sell all the junk you find and choose the look of walls and floors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/e7b96e6f4b3ecdc4dd6a61f68d026107.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/e7b96e6f4b3ecdc4dd6a61f68d026107.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/e7b96e6f4b3ecdc4dd6a61f68d026107.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Design the restaurant yourself. In time you will be able to unlock many additional interior items.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/7607f17daf0e481053ba0f6d342cddfe.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/7607f17daf0e481053ba0f6d342cddfe.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/7607f17daf0e481053ba0f6d342cddfe.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Pick your staff according to their skill level and payment expectations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/bb5e561a2e5a398254256741baf484ee.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/bb5e561a2e5a398254256741baf484ee.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/bb5e561a2e5a398254256741baf484ee.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Finally - feed your customers!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/c4b71ca58cf385a4af0ee536ed316b05.poster.avif?t=1717746186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/c4b71ca58cf385a4af0ee536ed316b05.webm?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877520/extras/c4b71ca58cf385a4af0ee536ed316b05.mp4?t=1717746186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In time new opportunities will open up and allow for branching out into different food businesses. Manage your finances, take care of your customer's needs and slowly but surely you will build your Food Empire.",
    "short_description": "Build your very own Food Empire in this economic strategy game. From diners and burger joints to succesful restaurants, with everything in between, you decide how to expand your brand. Buy properties, design the look of your restaurant, hire staff and finally feed all those hungry customers!",
